{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"58","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Expression"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One day Vasya was solving arithmetical problems. He wrote down an expression "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a + b = c"},{"kind":"text","text":" in his notebook. When the teacher checked Vasya's work it turned out that Vasya had solved the problem incorrectly. Now Vasya tries to find excuses. He says that he simply forgot to write down several digits in numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":", but he can't remember what numbers they actually were. Help Vasya, find such numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"z"},{"kind":"text","text":", with which the following conditions are met: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x + y = z"},{"kind":"text","text":", "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" from the expression "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x + y = z"},{"kind":"text","text":" several digits can be erased in such a way that the result will be "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a + b = c"},{"kind":"text","text":", "}]